127:T959,**Qualität, Vertrauen und Transparenz – offiziell bestätigt**

In October 2025, plastship GmbH was successfully certified by [**TÜV NORD CERT GmbH**](https://empowerment.tuev-nord.de/de) according to DIN EN ISO 9001:2015 (Quality Management).

## Quality, trust and transparency – officially confirmed

The certificate confirms the establishment and implementation of an effective quality management system within the certified scope *“Trade in plastics”* – an important step towards making quality and reliability measurable within the plastics circular economy.\
This is in line with plastship’s services such as [recyclate sourcing](/procurement/), [industrial plastics disposal](/waste-disposal/), and innovative projects like the AI-based material analysis within the [KISS project](/benchmark/).

![](/images/cms/dfgh-da119c.webp)

> *For us, this certification marks an important milestone – it shows that we not only demand quality, but consistently integrate it into our processes.*

***– Andreas Bastian, Managing Director, plastship GmbH***

The certification underlines plastship’s commitment to understanding quality as a unifying element within the industry.\
This also includes active exchange with market partners to promote standards and further develop digital solutions.\
As part of this approach, plastship recently joined the **Entsorger Circle**, a network connecting waste management companies, recyclers and solution providers to foster **digitalisation, AI and innovation** in the waste management sector.

## Looking ahead – quality as the foundation of the circular economy

With ISO certification and active participation in industry initiatives, plastship reaffirms its commitment to establishing **transparency, digitalisation and quality** as key pillars of a sustainable European plastics circular economy.

📄 **Certificate Details**

- **Certificate Registration No.:** 44 100 251404
- **Scope:** Trade in plastics
- **Validity:** 16/10/2025 – 15/10/2028
- **Certification Body:** TÜV NORD CERT GmbH, Essen
- [Check certificate validity](https://www.tuev-nord.de/de/unternehmen/zertifizierung/zertifikatsdatenbank/)

If you have questions or suggestions, please contact me!

**Mirco Gattinger**, Marketing & Social Media Manager\
